  "description": "Secrets and configuration management library for .NET. Provides a unified abstraction for accessing secrets from multiple providers (File, Azure Key Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, Configuration, In-Memory). Integrated with HoneyDrunk.Kernel v0.8.0 for lifecycle management, health reporting, and distributed telemetry.",
